  "interpretations": {
    "aciddrop": "EnsureDmgOrHeal floor applies per hit after mitigation. Frontal range2-2 uses higher rate. S2 additional projectile is full damage, splitDamage=0.",
    "caper": "Boomerang outward speed15, return speed3.75, .01s turnaround; attack waits all projectiles returned. S1 offensive SP scales next projectile. S2 emits two full projectiles; talent rolls per emitted hit. Visual parabolic height is renderer scope."
